Today's Theme
Family

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.460
Me, my pet rabbit,

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.000
Me, my pet rabbit,
My mom, my little sister,

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.330
Me, my pet rabbit,
My mom, my little sister,
Also my old man

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.540
But I guess you could say...

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:00.880
