00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.080
Spring

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.250
Yo, Nanako... She said you 
gotta make it relatable.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.830
That's not the problem here!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.080
By the way, Ei-chan,

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.630
By the way, Ei-chan,
What made you want to start

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:17.880
By the way, Ei-chan,
What made you want to start
Writing senryu?

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.130
Hm? Oh...

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:27.000
S-so strong...

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.000
So this is the Beast of 
West Middle School...!

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.580
Who're you calling a beast?!
You're the one who picked a fight with me!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.290
I'm sick and tired of fighting all the time!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.460
I'd trade in my fists

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.920
I'd trade in my fists
If it meant living a life

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.290
I'd trade in my fists
If it meant living a life
Of laughter and smiles!

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:45.960
Yeah... It had such a cool, flowy rhythm,
and it felt good to let it all out, y'know?

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.290
Isn't that Busujima, the 
Beast of West Middle School?

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.830
Dude, he'll hear you! Shut up!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.500
Unfortunately, I'm kinda infamous...

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.630
Hey, Nanako... You shouldn't 
walk so close to me.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:03.250
You wouldn't want people 
to be scared of you, too.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.460
It doesn't matter

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.170
It doesn't matter
What they think, as long as I

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.630
It doesn't matter
What they think, as long as I
Get to be with you!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.580
Huh?! Wait, you-!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.330
