00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.830
You idiot... That's the kind of thing a girl
says to a guy she has a crush on!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.080
Then again, they do say not to look
a gift horse in the mouth...

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:38.500
Ow, ow, ow.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.540
H-hey, cut it out!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.460
