00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:46.330
Yukishiro

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:46.380
Welcome home, Big Sis.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:50.330
Hey, by the way, I heard a thug joined
your Literature Club...

