How's that working out?

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.290
He's bad at talking

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.540
He's bad at talking
And girls run away from him

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.130
He's bad at talking
And girls run away from him
Whenever he smiles

